# Code owners for dcw-engage
#
# Mirrors dcw-certificate-portal: the dcw-sysadmins team owns everything by
# default, with the sensitive infrastructure and security paths called out
# explicitly. The paths are adapted to this repo's layout — config lives in
# includes/, scripts in bin/ and cron/, SECURITY.md at the root, and there
# is no .env.

# Global Catch-All Rule
# The sysadmin team owns everything in the repository by default.
*                       @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins

# Core Infrastructure & Sensitive Data
# Strict control over the database schema, config templates, core includes,
# and script executions.
/database.sql           @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins
/includes/              @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins
/bin/                   @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins
/cron/                  @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins
/.htaccess              @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins

# Server Security & Workflows
# Protects GitHub automation and the security policy.
/.github/workflows/     @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins
/SECURITY.md            @Deoband-Community-Wikimedia/dcw-sysadmins
